# ============================================================================
# Available HAL drivers
# ============================================================================
# Use --list_devices={driver name} to enumerate available devices.

            xdna: AMD XDNA execution using libamdf
            rdna: AMD RDNA execution using libamdf
            cdna: AMD CDNA execution using libamdf
          amdgpu: AMD GPU execution using libamdf
            task: CPU execution using the IREE multithreading task system
          vulkan: Vulkan execution using the system loader
